  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**FileGrid – Operații.** Latență p50/p95/p99, throughput și rata de erori per categorie și per storage, comparația zi normală vs. vârf și memoria instanțelor `api`. Metricile `filegrid_*` (în afară de `filegrid_bulkhead_rejected_total`) apar după C12; datele vin din Prometheus (O8). Toate interogările agregă instanțele `api` cu `sum by (category, storage)`; gauge-urile identice pe instanțe (`filegrid_storage_up`, `filegrid_meter_unconfirmed`) cu `max`."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latență (filegrid_operation_seconds)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latență per categorie (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "description": "Cuantile din histograma filegrid_operation_seconds, toate instanțele api agregate (sum by category, le).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (category, le) (rate(filegrid_operation_seconds_bucket{category=~\"$category\", storage=~\"$storage\", operation=~\"$operation\", operation!=\"health\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{category}} p50",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (category, le) (rate(filegrid_operation_seconds_bucket{category=~\"$category\", storage=~\"$storage\", operation=~\"$operation\", operation!=\"health\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{category}} p95",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (category, le) (rate(filegrid_operation_seconds_bucket{category=~\"$category\", storage=~\"$storage\", operation=~\"$operation\", operation!=\"health\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{category}} p99",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
